sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant J as Publish job
  participant P as pgoctl
  participant G as GitHub Releases
  J->>P: pgoctl store resolve
  P->>G: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}
  G-->>P: visibility, default branch
  P-->>J: store, publish
  Note over J,G: A public repository without allow-public-profiles uses the Artifacts store
  alt branch is not publish-branch
    Note over J: collect and validate only,<br/>write a notice
  else collection or quality gate fails
    Note over J: publish nothing,<br/>builds keep the last snapshot
  else publish
    J->>P: pgoctl store publish --profile cpu.pprof
    P->>G: list the releases of the key
    P->>G: create the release of today as a draft (if absent)
    P->>G: upload runs--<run-id>-<attempt>.pprof
    Note over P: select the run with the highest<br/>quality_score as daily.pprof
    P->>G: download daily.pprof of each day in the window
    Note over P: normalize each day, then<br/>weighted merge into default.pgo
    P->>G: check that manifest.json did not change (concurrency)
    P->>G: replace daily.pprof, default.pgo and manifest.json
    P->>G: publish the draft as a prerelease, latest=false
    P->>G: delete releases older than the retention
    P-->>J: default.pgo and the tag
  end
